      {
        "author_name": "Frank F",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109892352912852041352/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKFtK0y4RCFWJ3TJ37ng9bf3RUSX-ZNBkatkjpm54wVcltO5Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Lack of humanity. An employee came to several family members to warn them to be careful with the carpet, not to enter and leave the living room too much, not to stand too close to the flowers... Please let people gather in peace and not invade them (especially the close family of the deceased) with these irrelevant comments.",
        "time": 1657474741,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "graveljeunevieve genevieve gravel",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111243711922100168250/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVAJzippCz5aDI_OC7DaoGIi5JA_Uj_bNx3rAywH4TFDVfnowAg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Annie was simply fantastic and very human with my 14-year-old teenager who just lost his dad. Thank you for everything.",
        "time": 1730146674,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Benoit Pilon",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109704910559007540448/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKg2HF6wnS39i9E8JlkyhKdRGAjupn4Kd4PNvYKKftj__rZ-A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "I would like to thank the entire team at Maison Roussin in Vaudreuil-Dorion for the funeral of my father, Mr. Aimé Pilon, on April 27th. They were very helpful, respectful, and professional. Their presence and support helped us greatly throughout the funeral process. Special thanks to Ms. Charlebois, Mr. Brunet, and Mr. Simard. Keep up the good work, it's greatly appreciated.\n\nBenoit",
        "time": 1556969771,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Richard Tourangeau",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110759734080463736119/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIXQqMSoCUH5RgpEjqotMxBASImRJePIoJlizkmj6igOWcKaw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 years ago",
        "text": "Excellent service! This place listens to you and doesn't try to take advantage of the situation to sell you a million different things. Very satisfied. Thank you, Maison Roussin.",
        "time": 1477491091,
        "translated": true
      }
